<item>
<title>Health</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=13710</link>
<description>Trained for health going down as I got shot, noticed this moved each time, so found code in game that modifies the value.. Knobbled that and it doesn't work, none of the enemies die :( So ended up looking for the printer that prints the health on the screen, when that's called it *must* be our ship, so I changed the printer to replace health.. Also, ended up using the same method for Shields and Ammo.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
<category>cheats</category>
