<item>
<title>Training Mission 1</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=13710</link>
<description>Completed a couple of levels, and hen trained between this game and a new game.. Eventually found a var that appeared to change. Thought it might be like a level complete table but it wasn't. So I used the debugger to check for reads from this address, and noted down all the other addresses that're read in the same func.. Used these as the start of the level complete table for each level. Discovered each level has a table of:-  Offset (in bytes) 0 - Completed 2P game 1 - Completed with Gold medal 2 - Completed with Green medal 3 - Completed with Blue medal 4 - Difficulty level ( 1 - 3 ) (easy/normal/hard)</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
<category>cheats</category>
<guid>http://xs.xploder.net/cheat/626259</guid>
